WEBVTT

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:22.290
"Welcome to Gyokuro City"

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:39.700
"Six Months Later"

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:50.450
Natsu.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:53.120
"First Year College Student (Repeater)"
"Natsusa Yuzuki"

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:55.790
"First Year College Student (Repeater)"
"Natsusa Yuzuki"
Sei. Good morning.

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:11.290
Feeling numb?

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:13.450
Yeah, a little.

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:14.870
But I'm fine.

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:15.950
"Second Year College Student"
"Seiichirou Shingyouji"
"Number 15, Full Back"

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:16.700
"Second Year College Student"
"Seiichirou Shingyouji"
"Number 15, Full Back"
Your stuff.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:22.870
I'm really fine though.

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:24.870
Your mom called me yesterday.

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:27.370
Crap! I forgot to call her back!

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:29.450
Guess she got a hold of you instead...

00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:33.410
Sorry, was it about the paperwork
for repeating the year?

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:36.830
The first two minutes were
about you repeating a year.

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:40.540
The last hour of it was about how the
idol group she loves is breaking up.

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:42.540
My part was so short!

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:46.200
Your mom was crying.

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:48.410
About the idol group, right?

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:53.580
Is it tough?

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.450
No, I'm fine.

00:01:55.450 --> 00:02:00.620
I just haven't walked a long
distance in a while. Don't worry.

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:06.290
But, well, I guess I'm about
to make you worry a lot...

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:40.410
"No. 1"
"I'm Super Rookie number 24! <star>"

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.410
See you later.

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.580
Go attend your own classes.

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:00.660
It'll be a problem if you
get held back a year, too.

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:02.540
I'll come and get you after class.

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:03.950
Wait for me.

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:07.250
Thanks. I'll try to get used
to things as quickly as I can.

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:08.660
I don't mind it.

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:15.040
Natsu-<i>senpai</i>!

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.870
I was so worried about you!

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:22.080
Is it okay to come back so quickly?!

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:23.580
Uh, yeah.

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:25.580
Looks like I'm going to be a
first year with you now.

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.000
Take care of me during class.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:27.120
"First Year College Student"
"Fuuga Saitou"
"Number 1, Left Prop"

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:29.700
"First Year College Student"
"Fuuga Saitou"
"Number 1, Left Prop"
Yes! Ask me for anything!

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:31.250
I'll support you the best I can!

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:36.200
Th-Thanks. Why don't you wipe yourself up first?

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:37.870
Oh! Sorry!

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:39.620
I ran all the way here!

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:41.660
"Waft"

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:47.370
Oh, Yasunari.

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:49.830
"First Year College Student"
"Yasunari Tsuru"
"Number 11, Left Wing"

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:52.910
Long time no see! How have you been?

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:54.330
Yes.

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:58.950
Oh, that's right.

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:02.330
Sei showed me the videos of the
league fixtures this year--

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:04.540
Are you giving me advice?

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:06.790
No... That's not...

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:11.080
I don't need any advice. Especially from you.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:14.080
Yasunari?!

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.910
Hey, Yasunari! Hold on!

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:21.370
Did I do something?

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:24.580
He wasn't like that in high school, right?

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:29.700
"Doushisha University Wing"
"Natsusa Yuzuki"

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:33.040
"First Year College Student"
"Yuu Mashiro"
"C Team"

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:35.830
It stinks!

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:44.040
I'm so nervous.

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:45.700
What are you nervous about?

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:47.370
Hm? Nothing...

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:48.660
That's right!

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.750
Let's hurry, Natsu-<i>senpai</i>!

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:52.790
Everyone is waiting for you!

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:55.450
Natsusa! Welcome back!

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.620
"Third Year College Student"
"Ethan Taylor"
"Number 8, Number 8"

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:00.910
That's dangerous.

00:06:00.910 --> 00:06:02.500
Taylor! Stop that!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:02.830
"Fourth Year College Student"
"Ikuto Yufu"
"Number 12, Left Centre" "Vice-Captain"

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:05.000
"Fourth Year College Student"
"Ikuto Yufu"
"Number 12, Left Centre" "Vice-Captain"
Today is Natsusa's first day of school.

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:07.370
Oh! Sorry!

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:09.250
Did you get shorter while
you were in the hospital?

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:09.660
"Third Year College Student"
"Sousuke Yamada"
"Number 3, Right Prop"

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:12.080
"Third Year College Student"
"Sousuke Yamada"
"Number 3, Right Prop"
No, he probably lost a lot of muscle mass.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:15.000
That'll happen when you've
been in bed for six months.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:15.330
"Third Year College Student"
"Syouta U"
"Number 23, Reserve"

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:16.370
"Third Year College Student"
"Syouta U"
"Number 23, Reserve"
No, no.

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:18.620
"Third Year College Student"
"Syouta U"
"Number 23, Reserve"
I think he was like this to begin with.

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:19.000
"Poke Poke"
"Squish Squish"

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.330
"Poke Poke"
"Squish Squish"
Has everyone's sense of delicacy
been completely destroyed?

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:23.950
Oh!

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:24.330
"Third Year College Student"
"Takumi Hidaka"
"Number 9, Scrum Half"

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:26.290
"Third Year College Student"
"Takumi Hidaka"
"Number 9, Scrum Half"
Welcome back, Natsusa!

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:27.330
Natsusa!

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:29.250
Are you all right now?

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:34.370
Taku-<i>senpai</i>! Everyone, it's been a while.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:35.700
Why are you being held up?

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:36.450
We're celebrating.

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:36.700
"Fourth Year College Student"
"Gakuto Zaitsu"
"Number 2, Hooker" "Captain"

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.540
"Fourth Year College Student"
"Gakuto Zaitsu"
"Number 2, Hooker" "Captain"
Yes! We're taking care of him!

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.160
You mean, you're bullying me!

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:41.370
Hey.

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.040
Hurry up and start stretching.

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:46.540
Yes!

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:49.080
Natsusa, we'll see you later.

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:00.250
Well, see you later.

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:01.450
Yeah.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:09.250
Captain, it has been a while.

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:10.700
Are you really sure?

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.580
Huh? Can't I?

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:14.040
Am I too annoying, after all?

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:14.910
Huh?

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:17.040
I'm annoying. I get it.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:20.120
I got the feeling that's what you thought of me...

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:22.080
No...

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:24.910
Natsusa. Don't cause Gakuto so much trouble.

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:27.660
I just wanted to make sure.

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:29.450
I will respect your wishes.

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:31.080
Wait until the meeting.

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:40.040
The league fixtures have already started
and we don't have enough people.

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:42.500
It would actually be a big help.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:43.700
Yes!

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:46.080
"Doushisha University Rugby Club"

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:47.200
"Doushisha University Rugby Club"
So, in other words...

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:55.000
Natsusa will be our rugby manager and trainer!
Give him some applause!

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:06.620
I will probably cause you trouble in
the beginning, but I will try my best!

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:15.120
Looks like he's a little mad...

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:20.000
Does that mean that you will
help us stretch, be our timekeeper,

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:23.450
and might even wash our uniforms?

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:25.660
Well... I guess?

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:28.450
Seriously? That's...

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:30.580
...really motivating!

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:35.290
Well, let's end our meeting today with that.

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:39.330
Everyone, don't forget to stretch
and ice yourselves down properly.

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:50.410
You're mad.

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:52.750
Hey, don't ignore me.

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:54.120
Are you mad?

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:55.290
Not really.

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:58.790
You're completely pissed!

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:03.700
You would have been
against it if I told you, right?

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:07.330
Managers run and carry heavy things.

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:10.330
You'd have to stand the entire time we practice.
Chilly days may hurt your body.

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:11.950
I'll be careful!

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:13.580
That can only get you so far.

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:21.700
...lease...

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:23.790
It is a serious hernia.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:26.160
Please refrain from any
strenuous physical activity.

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:29.160
Rugby? Of course not.

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:34.540
I cannot guarantee that your body
could handle that kind of stress on it.

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:35.750
Please...

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:42.040
Please! Sei!

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:50.120
Please let me stay close to rugby!

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:52.120
Are you sure about this?

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:53.410
It'll be tough on you.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:57.000
Yeah!

00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:01.580
Well, if you can't move anymore,
I'll take care of you.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.080
Don't run like that.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.750
Aren't you hungry?

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:13.330
Want to eat some of your childhood
friend's home cooking today?

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:15.540
I do. Chicken tempura.

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:16.790
Chicken tempura?

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:20.330
That... will take a lot of time...

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:24.000
You're the one who suggested it,
so don't act all lazy about it.

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:29.200
Aww, I'm so hungry!

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:30.910
Natsu-<i>senpai</i>!

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:33.120
Seiichirou-<i>san</i>!

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:39.790
Fuuga, can we eat with you?

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:41.160
Of course!

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:43.620
Um! Nice to meet you!

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:46.540
Yayoi Tsudura-<i>kun</i>.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:48.250
Kotori Kureha-<i>kun</i>.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:48.870
You're both from Fukuoka
South High School, right?

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:51.370
"First Year College Student"
"Kotori Kureha" "Number 21, Reserve"
You're both from Fukuoka
South High School, right?

00:10:51.370 --> 00:10:52.750
"First Year College Student"
"Yayoi Tsudura" "Number 22, Reserve"

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:53.750
"First Year College Student"
"Yayoi Tsudura" "Number 22, Reserve"
Yes! I'm so happy that you remember our names!

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:56.790
Yes! I'm so happy that you remember our names!

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:58.750
Right? Kotori?

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:00.000
I guess...

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:05.620
Once I decided to become manager,
I memorized the profiles of all the members.

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:10.660
When did the two of you start rugby?

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:12.910
I played against you in
high school a number of times.

00:11:12.910 --> 00:11:14.410
--At the time, I--
--My name.

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:15.700
Huh?

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:20.080
I don't like my name,
so please stop saying it so often.

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:21.580
Kotori.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:22.500
Kureha...

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:25.370
N-No! S-Sorry...

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:29.120
I feel like I've been cut-off a lot today.

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:36.200
Fuuga, your appetite hasn't changed at all.

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:39.290
Yayoi-<i>kun</i>, you eat a lot for being so skinny.

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:43.080
Hey, Fuuga.

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:46.830
Isn't that first-year student Yuu Mashiro-<i>kun</i>?

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:49.910
From Kyushu's Raselle High School.

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:55.450
The fact that he was from such a
smart school left an impression on me.

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:57.250
You don't eat with him?

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:58.790
Oh, yes.

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:05.200
We take a lot of classes together, but he
always wants to be alone when he eats.

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:19.410
Yuzuki-<i>kun</i>!

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:21.000
Oh! Yes!

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:22.870
Please bring some more ice!

00:12:22.870 --> 00:12:24.160
Yes.

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:31.040
Yuzuki-<i>kun</i>, the water bottles!
You forgot to wash them!

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:32.250
Yes!

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:38.200
Who washed the towels without
shaking out the sand first?!

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:40.200
The laundry machine will break!

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:41.620
Yes...

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:45.950
Wasn't the sports drink today
really watered down?

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.660
It was lukewarm, too.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:50.580
Yeah. Natsusa-<i>san </i>made that, right?

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:53.200
Shoot! I did it out of habit...

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:56.450
It really breaks my concentration
when the sports drink tastes bad...

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:59.580
Is he really planning to become a manager?

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:01.000
Isn't that awkward?

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:07.750
A rookie that was in the middle of the limelight
last year wants to be a manager this year?

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:10.620
It's probably the worst for Yasunari.

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:12.450
I mean, he has his old position.

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:16.500
But I heard he can't be a player after that injury.

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:19.830
I heard that Ibuki-<i>san </i>quit the club
because of that accident, too.

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:24.040
I joined because I admired
Ibuki-<i>san </i>and now he's gone...

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:25.830
I know what you mean.

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.330
Well... I wonder about that...

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.330
It'd be for the best.

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:40.910
It'll be easier for me to pick you up.

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:45.870
That's true, but I'm a manager now...

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:47.500
What are you talking about?

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:49.200
Nothing at all!

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:52.330
Can you let Natsu live in the dorms with us?

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:53.750
Hey! Sei!

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:58.000
True, that would make it easier
for you as a manager, too.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:00.660
And you used to live in the dorms, anyway.

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:03.750
I'll discuss it with the coach and Gakuto.

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:06.160
Please.

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:07.700
B-But...!

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:14.160
But there will be people who won't like that!

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:15.870
There's no one like that.

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:18.950
There is! You just don't notice, Sei.

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:19.620
Hey!

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:21.040
Someone please come help!

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.250
Huh?

00:14:25.790 --> 00:14:27.660
Oh, my...

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:35.580
Oh. Are you awake?

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:36.790
Good morning.

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:41.290
Don't push yourself too much.

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:47.370
You passed out during running practice.

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:49.750
Probably due to anemia.

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:51.870
I-I'm sorry.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:55.700
I-I'm fine now. Thank you very much.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:00.870
Let's go to the hospital.

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:04.830
Huh? N-No! I'm really fine!

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:12.540
And, I have to practice more than
everyone else. I'm already so far behind...

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:18.540
Mashiro-<i>kun</i>, don't you think that the
senior students treat me awfully well?

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:22.500
Huh? Oh, yes. I do...

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:26.450
Right? Let me teach you the ropes.

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:30.660
You just need to rotate these
three sentences. Super easy.

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:34.620
First... Huh? Really?!

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:36.830
Now, repeat after me.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.870
Huh? U-Um...

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:41.540
You should lean forward a bit at, "Huh?"

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:46.160
Then, pull back and widen your
eyes when you say, "Really?!"

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:49.410
Huh? Really...?

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:50.580
The second one is...

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:54.700
You sure know your stuff.

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:56.160
The last is...

00:15:56.160 --> 00:15:57.790
I learned a lot from you!

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:00.410
I... I learned a lot from you.

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:04.200
Good, you're getting the hang of it now.

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:05.450
But there's one more thing.

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:07.620
This is the most important.

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:09.620
So, it's more than three...

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:13.160
If your senior wants to take you somewhere,
you gotta respond like this.

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:17.370
Huh? Really? I really want to go!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:19.700
Now, repeat after me.

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:21.660
"Yamamoto Central Hospital"

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:31.080
I was told I have anemia and a gastric ulcer
that was caused by malnutrition and stress.

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:34.040
Why did this happen?

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:40.080
I always admired Maisagi High
from the Oita prefecture.

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:46.540
Both you, Shingyouji-<i>san</i>, and Ueoka-<i>san</i>
were so amazing and sparkled so brightly.

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:49.910
Of course, I went to see
the three of you in Hanazono.

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:52.290
I was so moved.

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:55.250
Raselle didn't have a strong rugby team...

00:16:55.250 --> 00:17:02.370
I tried to get into this university so
I could play rugby with you, but...

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:07.950
I'm so lacking, I can't even keep up
with practice, much less be a regular.

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:13.290
To think I got an ulcer from the stress...

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:15.790
Do you love rugby?

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:19.580
I don't really know right now...

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:21.160
I see.

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:27.200
I love it. Even now, when I can't play.

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:34.700
But I guess I look pretty pathetic.

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:39.700
I'm clinging onto rugby while everyone pities me.

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:40.830
That's not true!

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:42.700
But I thought about it.

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:47.040
If I worry about looking pathetic
and can't say I love rugby,

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:51.540
it means I love myself more than I love rugby.

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:57.370
I think my pathetic self that keeps
loving rugby is pretty cool.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:00.790
"After Hours Counter"

00:18:00.790 --> 00:18:03.200
"After Hours Counter"
I think it's fine to quit.

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:03.950
"After Hours Counter"
To be honest, it'd be really hard for you
to become a regular in our strong school.

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:08.750
To be honest, it'd be really hard for you
to become a regular in our strong school.

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:11.830
There's no need to force
yourself to cling onto rugby.

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:15.870
But let's ignore all those things for now.

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:18.410
Do you love rugby, Mashiro-<i>kun</i>?

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:22.410
I do...

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:26.250
I really love rugby!

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:27.450
I see.

00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:32.450
Your appetite is back?

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:33.500
Right!

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:36.370
Let's go get some udon noodles
that are gentle on your stomach.

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:38.000
I know a delicious place.

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:41.950
Huh? Right now? U-Um, but...

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:44.580
I have to go back and report to the captain...

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:45.950
Hmm?

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:51.250
Ah, um... Really?

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:52.830
I really want to go!

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:55.000
Okay! Good job.

00:18:58.290 --> 00:18:59.330
Huh?

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:00.660
Sei?

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:02.160
Shingyouji-<i>senpai</i>!

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:04.500
Huh? You were there?

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:05.660
Yeah.

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:09.500
Perfect timing. Want to go to that udon shop?

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:12.330
Oh! That's right, Mashiro-<i>kun</i>.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:15.040
Just eat what you can today.

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:15.790
Huh?

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:22.250
When I was playing rugby, watching others
eat a lot put a lot of pressure on me.

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:23.830
You're fine.

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:25.790
Natsu eats like a tiny ant.

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:27.500
Isn't that exaggerating a little too far?!

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.290
Don't use bugs as an example!

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:30.950
Then, you eat like a tick?

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:44.200
I am the first-year student, Yuu Mashiro.

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:47.450
Starting today, I will be working
as one of the managers.

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:49.080
Please take care of me!

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:01.750
Natsusa!

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:03.750
O-Ouch! That hurts, Ikuto-<i>san</i>!

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:06.250
What are you doing?!

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:14.080
You said yourself that you needed more
managers when I said I wanted to be one!

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:18.830
That doesn't mean I wanted you to
recruit managers from the players!

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:23.910
If you're going to recruit more managers,
a sexy female one would motivate me more!

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:24.410
"Voluntary Restraint"

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:26.540
"Voluntary Restraint"
That's right! Bring in a girl!

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:31.290
Huh? But Yuu is really good as a time keeper.

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:36.870
He's smart, so he can keep track of the budget,
schedule, and update the website.

00:20:36.870 --> 00:20:40.040
Well, when you put it that way...

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:43.660
As expected! You know your
stuff because you're so smart!

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:48.370
Well, I was thinking the
same thing from the start.

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:50.410
Huh? Really?!

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:54.040
They say experienced players need
a strong team of managers.

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:56.910
I see. I learned another thing from you!

00:20:56.910 --> 00:20:59.750
Natsusa's choice of people is really cool!

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:03.080
Everyone! You need to realize he's
making fools out of all of you!

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:06.410
Where's the Vaseline?

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:08.620
Oh, I'll go look for it!

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:14.250
Where is it?

00:21:33.040 --> 00:21:35.120
Five more minutes...

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:38.290
Ouch!

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:44.660
Fine, I got it.

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:48.790
Damn, who influenced Mikan
to become so violent...

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:52.790
Morning, Toriten.

00:21:59.200 --> 00:22:02.870
Where did you pull all this stuff from?

00:23:41.950 --> 00:23:42.160
"The Weight of a Wallet and the
Wallet's Owner is Proportional"

00:23:42.160 --> 00:23:43.910
"The Weight of a Wallet and the
Wallet's Owner is Proportional"
Sorry we didn't play any rugby.

00:23:43.910 --> 00:23:46.950
"The Weight of a Wallet and the
Wallet's Owner is Proportional"
We won't really do much rugby in
episode two either, but keep watching!
